  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit with an attack using a cataclysm bolt, the attack deals normal damage. Then roll a d6 to determine its additional effect: <strong>1-2</strong> a blast of fire (3d8 fire to the target and each creature within 5 feet); <strong>3-4</strong> jagged ice (DC 17 Dexterity save or 1d10 cold and restrained until the end of your next turn); <strong>5</strong> a necrotic pulse (2d6 necrotic, DC 16 Strength save or stunned until the end of your next turn); <strong>6</strong> shrapnel (six ranged attacks at +7 for 1d6 piercing each).</p>",
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
